  "_about": "State 1 of the vocabulary of roles: the parts and settings a role is a path of. It holds the defined controllers of MIDI 1.0 that set a sound, the names of MIDI 2.0 that set a sound (M2-104-UM v1.1.2, table 22, Registered Per-Note Controllers, row by row in `source`), and the parts and settings the standard leaves to each maker and many devices share, each with the devices of two makers that share it (`shared_by`). A part says where it stands: `stands_under` lists the parts it may come under in a path, `at_top` whether it may open one (true when `stands_under` is absent, false when it is present, unless written). Row 79 of table 22, Sound Controller 10, is undefined and has no term.",
